Prospero:
 You are as good as the product of Cordelia and Cordelia.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of the sum of a big big hero and a hero and the product of Romeo and Lady Macbeth.
 You are as good as the sum of yourself and the product of a big hero and Ophelia.
 Open your heart.
[Exeunt]

